      "text": "UPPER ENDOSCOPY"
    },
    {
      "id": "P2",
      "text": "Date of service: 2026-10-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "P3",
      "text": "Endoscopist: Synthetic Endoscopist, MD (fictional)"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4",
      "text": "Anesthesia: Monitored anesthesia care by the anesthesia team"
    },
    {
      "id": "P5",
      "text": "Indication: Second opinion on an upper endoscopy done elsewhere; the procedure is described below."
    },
    {
      "id": "P6",
      "text": "Procedure: Consent was confirmed. A bite block was inserted. The adult gastroscope was passed into the esophagus under direct vision."
    },
    {
      "id": "P7",
      "text": "The scope was advanced through the stomach and the pylorus into the second part of the duodenum."
    },
    {
      "id": "P8",
      "text": "On withdrawal, cold forceps biopsies were taken from the proximal and distal esophagus."
    },
    {
      "id": "P9",
      "text": "Findings: Rings and furrows in the esophagus. Normal stomach and duodenum."
    },
    {
      "id": "P10",
      "text": "Impression: Rings and furrows; biopsied."
    },
    {
      "id": "P11",
      "text": "Plan: Repeat EGD in 8 weeks."
    }
  ],
